as blood red)","kjv_def":"blood, strength.","n":2,"o":"ISA63:3 ISA63:6"},"H5333":{"lemma":"נְצִיב","xlit":"nᵉtsîyb","pron":"nets-eeb'","derivation":"or נְצִב; from H5324 (נָצַב);","strongs_def":"something stationary, i.e. a prefect, a military post, a statue","kjv_def":"garrison, officer, pillar.","n":10,"o":"GEN19:26 1SA10:5 1SA13:3 1SA13:4 2SA8:6 2SA8:14 1KI4:19 1CH11:16 1CH18:13 2CH17:2"},"H5334":{"lemma":"נְצִיב","xlit":"Nᵉtsîyb","pron":"nets-eeb'","derivation":"the same as H5333 (נְצִיב); station;","strongs_def":"Netsib, a place in Palestine","kjv_def":"Nezib.","n":1,"o":"JOS15:43"},"H5335":{"lemma":"נְצִיחַ","xlit":"nᵉtsîyach","pron":"nets-ee'-akh","derivation":"from H5329 (נָצַח); conspicuous;","strongs_def":"Netsiach, a Temple-servant","kjv_def":"Neziah.","n":2,"o":"EZR2:54 NEH7:56"},"H5336":{"lemma":"נָצִיר","xlit":"nâtsîyr","pron":"naw-tsere'","derivation":"from H5341 (נָצַר);","strongs_def":"properly, conservative; but used passively, delivered","kjv_def":"preserved.","n":0,"o":""},"H5337":{"lemma":"נָצַל","xlit":"nâtsal","pron":"naw-tsal'","derivation":"a primitive root;","strongs_def":"to snatch away, whether in a good or a bad sense","kjv_def":"[idiom] at all, defend, deliver (self), escape, [idiom] without fail, part, pluck, preserve, recover, rescue, rid, save, spoil, strip, [idiom] surely, take (out).","n":193,"o":"GEN31:9 GEN31:16 GEN32:11 GEN32:30 GEN37:21 GEN37:22 EXO2:19 EXO3:8 EXO3:22 EXO5:23 EXO6:6 EXO12:27 EXO12:36 EXO18:4 EXO18:8 EXO18:9 EXO18:10 EXO33:6 NUM35:25 DEU23:14 DEU23:15 DEU25:11 DEU32:39 JOS2:13 JOS9:26 JOS22:31 JOS24:10 JDG6:9 JDG8:34 JDG9:17 JDG10:15 JDG11:26 JDG18:28 1SA4:8 1SA7:3 1SA7:14 1SA10:18 1SA12:10 1SA12:11 1SA12:21 1SA14:48 1SA17:35 1SA17:37 1SA26:24 1SA30:8 1SA30:18 1SA30:22 2SA12:7 2SA14:6 2SA14:16 2SA19:9 2SA20:6 2SA22:1 2SA22:18 2SA22:49 2SA23:12 2KI17:39 2KI18:29 2KI18:30 2KI18:32 2KI18:33 2KI18:34 2KI18:35 2KI19:11 2KI19:12 2KI20:6 1CH11:14 1CH16:35 2CH20:25 2CH25:15 2CH32:11 2CH32:13 2CH32:14 2CH32:15 2CH32:17 E